    "html": "<p>The average background activity at a certain location is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\"></span> Bq. When a sample of a radioactive nuclide is placed at this location, a detector measures an activity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"700\"></span> Bq. The half-life of the nuclide is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> minutes. What activity does the detector measure after two hours?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\"></span> Bq</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"70\"></span> Bq</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"80\"></span> Bq</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> Bq</li>\n</ol>"
